title: "HNTD search: from the form to the shortlist"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: waiting
    lg1: running
    lg2: done
    lg3: failed
    lg4: gone
    lg5: Breaks OneRunAtATime
    lg6: Breaks OneRunAtATime in some cases
    lg7: Path to the OneRunAtATime bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 purple
  class lg5 breaks
  class lg6 mayBreak
  class lg7 bugPath
  s0: No search yet
  s1: In queue
  s2: Deleted
  s3: Processing
  s4: Completed, shortlist shown
  s5: Deleted, the pipeline still works on it
  s6: Failed
  s7: In queue, a run still works on it
  s8: Processing, no pipeline run alive
  s9: Processing, two runs at once
  s10: Completed, a run still works on it
  s11: Failed, a run still works on it
  s12: In queue, a run still works on it, two runs at once
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you start a search
  s1 --> s3: a pipeline run claims it
  s3 --> s4: the run delivers the shortlist
  s3 --> s5: you delete the search
  s3 --> s6: the run reports a failure
  s3 --> s7: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
  s3 --> s8: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s4 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  s5 --> s2: the run stops, the search is gone
  s6 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  s7 --> s1: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s7 --> s4: the run delivers the shortlist
  s7 --> s6: the run reports a failure
  s7 --> s9: a pipeline run claims it
  s8 --> s1: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
  s9 --> s3: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s9 --> s10: the run delivers the shortlist
  s9 --> s5: you delete the search
  s9 --> s11: the run reports a failure
  s9 --> s12: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
  s10 --> s4: the Claude Code session ends mid-run or the run's failure is refused or the run delivers the shortlist
  s10 --> s7: you reset it from the terminal
  s11 --> s4: the run delivers the shortlist
  s11 --> s6: the Claude Code session ends mid-run or the run reports a failure
  s11 --> s7: you reset it from the terminal
  s12 --> s7: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s12 --> s10: the run delivers the shortlist
  s12 --> s11: the run reports a failure
